OL,3,GNEWSAHomes at heart of new Universal
OL,4,Aresort demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FWorkers have begun demolishing houses
OL,7,Fthat lie in the way of what will be
OL,8,FUniversal's new UK theme park in
OL,9,FBedfordshire.
OL,11,FContractors want to raze all properties
OL,12,Fin Manor Road, Kempston Hardwick, but
OL,13,Fit is unknown how many will be knocked
OL,14,Fdown before the road has to reopen on
OL,15,F28 November.
OL,17,FIt marks the latest stage of a standoff
OL,18,Fbetween Universal and the residents,
OL,19,Fsome of whom have refused to leave
OL,20,Ftheir homes.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,372,370,200,160,0,100
