OL,3,GNEWSAHomes at heart of new Universal
OL,4,Aresort demolished
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe theme park developer said it
OL,7,Fremained "committed to being a good
OL,8,Fneighbour" during the project, which is
OL,9,Fbeing built over 476 acres (193ha) of
OL,10,Fland.
